Earmarking: transfers of benefits subject to earmarking orders not accepted. We will also not support earmarking orders being made against benefits held within this plan.
Disqualifying pension credit: this plan will accept funds awarded as part of a divorce settlement which have come from crystallised funds, with advance notice.
Death Benefit: Any death benefits applicable to this plan are in line with current UK legislations at the time of death.
## Value:
The transfer value of this plan is the same as the current value.
Flexi Access Drawdown: Flexi Single and Flexi Phased drawdown are available on this plan.
## Uncrystallised Fund Pension Lump Sum (UFPLS):
Uncrystallised fund pension lump sum is not applicable to this plan.
