2,206/month) is materially lower than the ~£3,293–3,710/month described as current spending in the report narrative. The Fact Find figure of £2,206.67 matches the cashflow input, but the report's own text describes higher spending, creating an unresolved inconsistency. Yvette's income in the cashflow also exceeds the Fact Find figure without explanation. These represent genuine data inconsistency concerns affecting the robustness of the cashflow conclusion. Vulnerability: no vulnerability factors identified in the evidence that would materially affect this assessment.","citations":[{"passageId":"P1","source":"Fact Find (1).md","category":"B","quote":null,"cells":["Calculated Total Monthly Household Expenditure","£ 2,206.67"]},{"passageId":"P1","source":"Fact Find (1).md","category":"B","quote":null,"cells":["Total Net Monthly Income","£ 2,590.00"]},{"passageId":"P1","source":"Fact Find (1).md","category":"B","quote":null,"cells":["Total Monthly Disposable Income","£ 383.33"]},{"passageId":"P1","source":"Fact Find (1).md","category":"B","quote":null,"cells":["Amount put aside for Emergency Fund","£ 10,000.00"]},{"passageId":"P1","source":"Fact Find (1).md","category":"B","quote":null,"cells":["Emergency Fund Shortfall","£ 0.00"]},{"passageId":"P24","source":"Fact Find (1).md","category":"B","quote":null,"cells":["Net Basic Monthly Income","£ 890.00"]},{"passageId":"P24","source":"Fact Find (1).md","category":"B","quote":null,"cells":["Total Gross Annual Earnings","£ 14,000.00"]},{"passageId":"P20","source":"Cashflow - Current Situation.md","category":"F","quote":null,"cells":["DB Pension","22,000","0","22,000"]},{"passageId":"P20","source":"Cashflow - Current Situation.md","category":"F","quote":null,"cells":["Employment","0","16,800","16,800"]},{"passageId":"P20","source":"Cashflow - Current Situation.md","category":"F","quote":null,"cells":["Total Regular Income","22,000","16,800","38,800"]},{"passageId":"P20","source":"Cashflow - Current Situation.md","category":"