The Aviva Platform is an online service which allows you to hold investments in one place in a range of underlying products; an Investment Portfolio, an ISA Portfolio and a Pension Portfolio.
By consolidating your investments, you can easily review and plan your strategy to match your selected goals.
You can potentially save time and money by seeing everything in one place, as well as benefiting from reduced fund management charges in a large and growing range of investment funds.
## What is a stocks and shares ISA?
A stocks and shares ISA is an Individual Savings Account, a tax-efficient way of saving and investing available to UK residents aged 18 or over.
## What is the ISA Portfolio?
The ISA Portfolio is a flexible stocks and shares ISA.
It allows you to invest in a broader range of investments than a cash ISA. You can make your own investment decisions, together with your financial adviser, who will tell us how you want to invest your money.
